  "job_B8.4.3.1_20251003_114835": {
    "chunk_text": "as hig feollon on hyra ansyne & hym swy\u00fee adredon. He geneal\u00e6hte \u00fea & hig \u00e6thran & him to cw\u00e6\u00fe, Arisa\u00f0 & ne ondr\u00e6da\u00fe eow. \u00d0a hig hyra eagan upphofon ne gesawon hig n\u00e6nne buton \u00feone H\u00e6lend sylfne. & \u00fea hig of \u00f0am munte eodon se H\u00e6lend hym bebead & \u00feus cw\u00e6\u00fe, nanum menn ne secgean ge \u00feis & \u00fea axodon hys leorningcnihtas hyne, hw\u00e6t secgea\u00f0 \u00fea boceras \u00fe\u00e6t gebyrige \u00e6rest cuman Heliam? \u00d0a andswarode he hym, witodlice Helias ys toweard & he geedniwa\u00f0 ealle \u00feing. So\u00felice ic eow secge \u00fe\u00e6t Helias com & hig hyne ne gecneowon ac hig dydon ymbe hyne swa hw\u00e6t \u00d0a ongeton hys leorningcnihtas \u00fe\u00e6t he hyt s\u00e6de be Iohanne \u00feam fulluhtere. And \u00fea he com to \u00fe\u00e6re menegu him to geneal\u00e6hte sum mann gebigedum cneowum toforan him & Drihten, gemiltsa minum suna for \u00feam \u00fee he ys fylleseoc & yfel \u00feola\u00f0; Oft he fyl\u00fe on fyr & & ic brohte hyne to \u00feinum leorningcnihtum & hig ne mihton hyne geh\u00e6lan. \u00d0a andswarode he him, Eala ge ungeleaffulle & \u00fewyre cneores, hu lange beo ic mid eow; Hu lange & \u00fea \u00fereade se H\u00e6lend hyne & se deofol hyne forlet & se cnapa w\u00e6s of \u00fe\u00e6re tide geh\u00e6led. \u00d0a geneal\u00e6hton hys leorningcnihtas him to & him to cw\u00e6don diglice,",
